{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-1","storyName":"嘈杂的天空","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"高登派秘书找到娜斯提，希望他们放弃临展前的工程检修。经过谈判，双方最终各退一步，娜斯提同意按照高登给出的名单上的顺序进行检修。另一边，助理研究员斯凯查封了一家名叫“幸运瘤兽”的公司。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["娜斯提","塞雷娅","斯凯？","温柔的女性","梅希亚","体验员A","斯凯","体验员B","？？？","雅斯彭"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_bg_38_g5_rhinelab_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_3","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"（萨卡兹语）凝结。","id":10},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$chasing_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_bat_chasing_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":11,"musicid":0},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"true","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_labamb","channel":"lab","loop":"true","volume":"0.4","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.1","duration":"0.3","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","volume":"1","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.15","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchairwall","volume":"0.5","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.15","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchairwall","volume":"1","id":32},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":33},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"密集的拳击声。","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"咒言在空气中捏塑出无形的墙，精准挡下瓦伊凡的每一拳，汗水打湿了旧拳套上“特里蒙理工”的字样。","id":37},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"良久，瓦伊凡停了下来。","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"呼——就到这里吧，谢谢你当我的陪练，娜斯提。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":49,"musicid":1},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":50},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"lab","fadetime":"2","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这才到你平日运动量的一半。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"是你该出发了。和其他人道过别了？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我没通知他们。马里亚姆就不用说了，缪尔赛思人在谢拉格，人事科和结构科的两位新主任我还不太熟。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#8$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"至于小贾斯汀和斐尔迪南，还是让他俩单独见面吧……","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这样不管是对自己刚从哪位高官的宴会上离开夸夸其谈，还是宣讲那些能让一个人成为科学界国王的新理论，两个人都有听众。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"再说，我只是出一趟差而已。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"需要工程科主任出的差可不多。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#5$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"特区政府批准了我们的申请，整合“地平弧光计划”的资源，以万星园的技术遗留为基础，继续推进浮空科技领域的革新。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#10$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"但他们同时对哥伦比亚全境的科技公司大开方便之门，甚至为此特批了一整个地块。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#10$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"进驻人员名单中不仅有烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局的官员，连梅兰德也下场了。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#10$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"我们的计划书，变成了万千计划书中的一份。让莱茵为整个地块提供基础工程支持，已经是他们对莱茵生命这个发起方最大的尊重了。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#9$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"政府官员、科技公司代表……毫无疑问，那个地块会很热闹。娜斯提，你并不擅长处理这类事情。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这段时间，我也没有听你抱怨过什么……总辖。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"……","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#8$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"星荚已经慢慢恢复如初，但人们望向天空的目光不会收回来。常识被颠覆之后，原本被忽视的地方便自然而然成了热土。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#10$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"自然而然？特殊贷款政策出台后，三分之一的企业增加了天空事业部门，中小型企业也纷纷转型，为了搭上“天空热”的便车不计代价。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你意有所指，但我对政治游戏不感兴趣。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"哪怕一切的发展不是我们所能控制的，莱茵生命也必须做这个发起方。尽可能地掌握主动权，才能尽可能地守住克丽斯腾留下的东西。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这并不难理解。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"嗯。那么，辛苦了。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"顺便问一句，你为什么不搬去克丽斯腾的办公室，而是在这间旧办公室外面加挂了一块“总辖构件科”的标牌？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"我习惯了这里。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"缪尔赛思也这样问过。她红着眼睛，掐着我的胳膊问我是不是因为怀念克丽斯腾，以及莱茵是不是总会为克丽斯腾留一个位置。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"看来，你只是觉得老地方比较舒适。毕竟这里的每一个细节都是你亲自确认过的。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"当初替你装修办公室的时候，你在我身后从头盯到尾，我一度怀疑你的强迫症比帕尔维斯还要严重。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#7$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"……","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"相比以前，莱茵生命并不会有什么变化，娜斯提。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"唔，还是有的，起码现在员工们来找总辖，不至于总是扑空了。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#5$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"……或许，你没有立场说这句话？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"所以，这也是你选我出这趟差的原因？","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"all","id":114},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":115},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","id":120},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_68_g1_groundparkstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":123},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tractor_amb","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":127},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.1","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"在这里剪一刀。对，就是这个角度，这样主干枝叶不会受到任何影响。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_prunethebranch","volume":"0.8","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"测试合格。斯凯，在正式铺设前你先帮我牵引一下。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_activation","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"下一组。感光性能正常，悬浮姿态稳定，能源输入输出也都没问题，同样需要牵引。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"哦，我需要工具箱里的拆卸套组，一会儿也帮我拿一下。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯？","text":"那之前的高速螺丝刀还有多功能扳手您还需要吗？","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#6$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"看情况……嗯？你的声音怎么了？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","focus":"n","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","bstart":"0","bend":"0","duration":"2","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":158},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$holiday_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_holiday_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":159,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的女性","text":"我真的很想帮助您，但现在我纽扣上挂着剪子，手里还牵了五棵……树？实在没有办法拿更多东西了。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"curtain","id":165},{"type":"bg","id":166,"from":"0.8","to":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"background","id":167},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_68_g1_groundparkstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"抱歉，让我来吧。斯凯走了？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的女性","text":"他跟您说了三遍他要去浮空层进行工程检修，您都没理他。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你刚刚可以提醒我。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的女性","text":"秘书的第一准则：安静地站在一边微笑，只接收上司的指令，谈话涉及机密时就应该自动关上耳朵。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的女性","text":"请放心，您刚刚说的数据和名词我一个都没听到，就算听到了我也听不懂。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我想起来了。你是行政部的人，高登的秘书。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的女性","text":"很荣幸您还能记得我，娜斯提主任。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我叫梅希亚，您也可以直接叫我小梅。我代表高登长官来邀请您共进午餐。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"他的工作邮箱应该是由你管理的？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您先前回复的十六封拒绝邮件长官都收到了。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那我长话短说。我知道他对基础工程没兴趣，他也应该清楚我不会接纳工作之外的“建议”。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#8$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"嗯……","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"哦，不过说到午餐……","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您改变主意了？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"现在确实该吃午餐了。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"娜斯提在工具箱里翻找了一阵，从十几种检测设备和收纳整齐的零件袋下，拿出了一块用锡纸裹得严严实实的长方体。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"梅希亚好奇地凑近。她想知道，眼前这个捉摸不透的莱茵主任，究竟是为了什么食物拒绝了云中餐厅最豪华的宴请和最高规格的服务。","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"然而在娜斯提面无表情地打开包装之后，梅希亚身为专业秘书的完美笑容出现了一丝裂缝。","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"background","id":210},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.5","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":211},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.5","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":212},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.55","fillto":"0.55","fadetime":"0.1","id":213},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.3","fillto":"0.3","fadetime":"0.1","id":214},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_68_i15.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.35","yScale":"1.35","x":"-30","y":"-10","fadetime":"3","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"imagetween","image":"68_i15","xTo":"-80","yTo":"40","duration":"5","block":"false","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您说的午餐就是这块……砖头？","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"（发音模糊）这是压缩饼干。","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"压缩饼干？","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"梅希亚无法把视线从那块“砖头”上挪开。","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你也饿了？要尝尝吗？","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0","id":225},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.4","fadetime":"0","id":226},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.55","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0","id":227},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.3","fillto":"0.51","fadetime":"0","id":228},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cakebgflgrnd","volume":"0.8","id":229},{"type":"imagetween","image":"68_i15","xTo":"-100","yTo":"0","duration":"0.5","block":"false","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"好的，谢谢您……","id":232},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"curtain","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"imagetween","image":"68_i15","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","duration":"20","block":"false","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"（艰难咀嚼）","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"（用力吞咽）","id":242},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"咳、咳！","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你可以拒绝。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"秘书的第二准则：不能拒绝上司的客人提出的邀请，你永远不知道什么举动会影响他们的合作关系。","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你一共有几条准则？","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"高登长官给了我一本两厘米厚的手册。","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"不过我可以提前告诉您，我最先记住也是最重要的那条——","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"无论遇到什么样的困难，都要尽最大努力完成上司的命令，因为没有人会听你辩解。","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不习惯就别吃了。","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"谢天谢地……不，我是说多谢款待。","id":254},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"其实我也有一条准则，只不过比较简单。","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您说？","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我在卡兹戴尔出生，学到的第一个道理就是：食物是珍贵的，任何人都不能在食物面前说谎。","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"梅希亚小姐，既然你现在拿着我的午餐，那就请对我说实话。","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"高登长官究竟想跟我“洽谈”什么？","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"charslot","id":265},{"type":"image","id":266},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_bg_68_g6_floatinglabmodule.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2045_1#1$1","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_energywell","volume":"0.2","loop":"true","channel":"en","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":272},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"报告！我们项目的核心创意是：人转酒不转，离心力替代引力，力求达成零重力太空巡航体验与品酒体验的完美融合！","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"jump","posto":"50,0","power":"20","times":"1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"“幸运瘤兽”浮空回转酒吧，让你体验“天”旋“地”转的——","id":277},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","isblock":"true","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"停，不用念广告词，我只会针对工程方面的整改进行评估和提问。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"另一位体验员呢，展品整改后有什么新的反馈？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员B","text":"呕……","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-150","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":288},{"type":"charslot","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","isblock":"true","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":293},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":294,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"他就是昨天晚上没有睡好！斯凯先生，我们通过复检了吧，不用取消进驻资格了吧？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"雅斯彭经理，无论从工程报告还是体验员的反馈来看，幸运瘤兽餐饮的这款浮空回转酒吧都不合格。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"en","fadetime":"2","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"供能不稳定这类技术难题我们也很想优化，但确实需要时间……","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"按照园区规定，我们给了三天。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"可研发人员光讨论解决方法至少就要花上五天！","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"“螺旋桨天堂”的企业流动量堪比特里蒙中心广场的十字路口，每个司机都有自己的事要办，但没有谁会去跟信号灯求情。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"就没有别的办法……对了，我们雇佣了近百名体验员，如果把他们辞退，就有资金去聘请更多研究员了！","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2045_1#1$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"呃，经理你昨天可答应了我们——","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"闭嘴！","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"雅斯彭经理，我看过“幸运瘤兽”的注册资料。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你原本只是小镇上的一个小杂货商，哪怕银行放低了天空事业的贷款审核标准，以你的专业水平，也不适合转型做浮空技术研究。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"而现在我们站在全泰拉第一座，也是唯一一座浮空的地块上，这里的一切都应配得上与它并肩。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"求求你，别撕下那张报告单，我把所有积蓄都投在“幸运瘤兽”上了，别撕……","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_papertear","volume":"1","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2045_1#1$1","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"就这么，结束了？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"两天之后，我又得回到特里蒙的高层写字楼外面擦玻璃去了？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员B","text":"呕……","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"吐吧老兄，我们也算体验过天上的日子了。等你回到拓荒地，吃不饱穿不暖……到时候连吐都吐不出来啦。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"300,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_68_g1_groundparkstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":361},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":362,"musicid":4},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"放弃展会开幕前的工程检修？不可能。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"高登长官认为，现在园区的所有科研力量都在争分夺秒地进行最后的收尾工作，暂停项目进行检修很有可能会影响展会开幕。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"另一方面，减少与科技公司来来回回的交流沟通，也能让您更好地投入莱茵生命的研究。长官一直非常体恤您。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"体恤？","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"刚来哥伦比亚的时候，我在荒地上流浪过几年，为拓荒队建过房子，也替运输队杀过匪徒。在摸到门道之前，我的日子过得都不太轻松。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"假如那时候就有像高登一样的好心人体恤我，替我处理一切我不擅长的工作……","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"那想必是很幸运的事。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那我一定已经死在荒地上了。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"而且，让莱茵放弃工程检修权，一定不是他真正想要的。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您怎么知道？","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你把他谈判时的样子模仿得太像，言辞中留下的陷阱和漏洞显而易见。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我不是卡特斯，不喜欢往洞里钻。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"说吧，他最终想达成的协约是什么？","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……如长官所言，您真的很聪明也很果断。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"那您应该可以理解，虽然长官能把控园区的行政管理，但真正影响整个舆论风口的，是莱茵。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"他不想在关键时刻出纰漏，也承担不起那个后果。因此，他根据各个项目的进度拟定了这份名单，希望您按照名单顺序检修。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"这样至少可以保证，在不考虑工程权归属的情况下，让检修流程尽可能少地影响到各个项目的推进，最大限度地预防冲突的出现。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"减少您的麻烦，就是减少他的麻烦。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我不会去研究高登在这份名单里藏的小心思，各退一步，我想我们已经达成了共识。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"把名单给我吧。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"感谢您的理解，娜斯提主任。那我就不打扰您工作了。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"最后一个问题。刚刚谈判的时候，你遵照的又是哪条准则？","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"第十二条：对你的上司要足够熟悉，谈判时必须一字不差地复述他的言论。在外，你就是上司的绝对代言人。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"不过娜斯提主任——","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"嗯？","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"高登长官在我来之前，反复提醒我莱茵生命的工程科主任是个多么难对付的人。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我一度很担心今天会蜷缩在您的办公室门口过夜，还提前在包里装了毯子。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"但您跟他说的不一样。虽然您不需要他人体恤，习惯用尖锐的方式解决问题，但您总在体恤别人。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"正因如此，现在我才能有时间去安心地吃一顿久违的午餐。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"谢谢您。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":430},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":432},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":439},{"type":"charslot","id":440},{"type":"background","id":441},{"type":"image","id":442}],"characters":["娜斯提","塞雷娅","斯凯？","温柔的女性","梅希亚","体验员A","斯凯","体验员B","？？？","雅斯彭"]}